{
  "tema": 6756,
  "slug": "la-foto-la-moto",
  "titulo": "Feminine nouns in -o (shortened words)",
  "subtitulo": "La foto, la moto, la radio.",
  "foto": "t08.jpg",
  "regla": "Some nouns ending in -o are feminine because they are short forms of feminine nouns: la foto (fotografía), la moto (motocicleta), la radio (radiodifusión), la disco (discoteca). They keep the feminine article and adjectives, and the plural adds -s.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "A few nouns in **-o** are **feminine**, because they are **short forms** of feminine words. The shortened word keeps the original gender."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Short form",
            "Full word",
            "Plural"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "la foto",
              "la fotografía",
              "las fotos"
            ],
            [
              "la moto",
              "la motocicleta",
              "las motos"
            ],
            [
              "la radio",
              "la radiodifusión",
              "las radios"
            ],
            [
              "la disco",
              "la discoteca",
              "las discos"
            ],
            [
              "la quimio",
              "la quimioterapia",
              "—"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Articles and adjectives are **feminine**: **una foto bonita**, **la moto roja**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The plural just adds **-s**: **las fotos**, **las motos**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "In Mexico you'll also hear **el radio** for the device. **La radio** is always right for the medium (_listening to the radio_)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The same thing happens with other endings: **la tele** (televisión), **la bici** (bicicleta)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
